<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-S2-012>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-S2-012" ;
  triage:title "7 LaunchGateGuard/DaemonSupervisor/LocalIpcClientTransportAdapter tests gated #[cfg(unix)] — ADR-007 violation" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm/src/composition.rs:1051,1067,1093,1112,1136,1166,1195 — seven tests for LaunchGateGuard, DaemonSupervisor, and LocalIpcClientTransportAdapter are gated #[cfg(unix)]. Sprint-S2 acceptance criteria and ADR-007 require same-host functional tests to work on Windows. These tests must be transport-neutral or have Windows-path alternatives; they cannot be unconditionally excluded from Windows compilation." ;
